  "description": "A world where superpowers manifest only in those who have reached the crossroads of life and death. Five years ago, a large sinkhole made numerous people, including high school student Kim Shin-gwan, into superpowers, and people set out to find the unidentified object called Repeater, which created the sinkhole. What will be the end of Kim Shin-gwan, caught up in the fight surrounding Repeater?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=783595), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8047315)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002882)",
